{"pageid": 1347, "title": "Thomas Carter", "revid": 2792, "categories": ["Characters", "Characters (SIKTC comics)", "Humans", "Tribulation"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Thomas Carter</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/7/7e/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_29WhatnotA_Cover.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250117235203\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 29WhatnotA Cover\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/7/7e/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_29WhatnotA_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250117235203\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/7/7e/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_29WhatnotA_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250117235203 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/7/7e/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_29WhatnotA_Cover.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250117235203 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Something Is Killing the Children 29WhatnotA Cover\" width=\"270\" height=\"432\" data-image-key=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_29WhatnotA_Cover.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Something Is Killing the Children 29WhatnotA Cover.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Sheriff of <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tribulation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHJpYnVsYXRpb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Tribulation</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Tribulation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHJpYnVsYXRpb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Tribulation, New Mexico</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_21\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 21\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #21</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_35\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 35\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #35</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Sheriff Thomas Carter</b> is a man who was the sheriff of <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tribulation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHJpYnVsYXRpb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Tribulation, New Mexico</span> during the 2021 <a href=\"/wiki/Duplicitype\" title=\"Duplicitype\">Duplicitype</a> Incident. Left in the dark about the existence of monsters, Carter was led by <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a> to believe that <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> was behind the murders, and allowed her to hunt the woman across his town. Following the death of Cutter and apparent death of Erica, he was paid off by <a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a> despite his confusion and insistence for answers.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Thomas Carter is a middle-aged man of European descent with light brown hair. and dark brown eyes. He is usually wearing a cowboy hat.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22\">Issue #22</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_23\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 23\">Issue #23</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_24\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 24\">Issue #24</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_25\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 25\">Issue #25</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_26\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 26\">Issue #26</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_27\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 27\">Issue #27</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_28\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 28\">Issue #28</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_29\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 29\">Issue #29</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_24\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 24\">Issue #30</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_35\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 35\">Issue #35</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_2\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i></span></h3>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f9871e603f397da18572ea9e22f2a297\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_29WhatnotA_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:115px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_29WhatnotA_Cover.jpg\" title=\"Something Is Killing the